  r45,预加载缓存数据源,"",source 配置 `cache_mode=preload_forever`,pipeline 启动前应调用 loader 并将结果缓存到 runtime.preloaded_cache,true
  r45,预加载缓存透传参数,"",source 配置 `cache_mode=preload_forever` 且包含 `params`,pipeline 启动前应调用 loader 并透传 params 的 kwargs,true
  r45,"cache-mode-拼写错误被拒绝","",source 配置 `cache_mode=prelaod_forever`(拼写错误),语义校验必须失败并报告 `sources.<id>.cache_mode` 的错误,true
  r289,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
